==Notes==
Each national team had to submit a squad of 22 players. Each squad included two goalkeepers, except Switzerland, Spain, Sweden and Italy who called three. [[George Robledo]] of [[Newcastle United F.C.|Newcastle United]] was the only player to play for a club outside of his country in the tournament.

